          ],
          "help": "Upstream rollback NUM_SPECULATIVE_TOKENS=5 MAX_NUM_SEQS=4 (graphs 1/2/4/6/12/18/24). Upstream measured it before its v13 defaults, not with them; the fourth request queued about 10 s at 7 drafts. Overrides the concurrency setting.",
